<title>FRANCE: Reuters 1st  EX-PARIS AMERICAS AIR CARGO MARKET.</title>
<headline>Reuters 1st  EX-PARIS AMERICAS AIR CARGO MARKET.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are current average ex-Paris French franc air cargo rates per kilo for a 100kg shipment with volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>			     APRIL 18		MARCH 24</p>
<p>				     NORTH AMERICA</p>
<p>  PAR-JFK		  5.50		     5.45</p>
<p>  PAR-CHI		  5.80		     5.80</p>
<p>  PAR-LAX		  6.65		     6.55</p>
<p>  PAR-YMX(MONTREAL)    6.80		     6.75</p>
<p>				    LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p>  PAR-MEX		 11.90		    N.A.</p>
<p>  PAR-SAO		 18.00		    N.A.</p>
<p>The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller cargo agents based at the Paris airports.</p>
<p>All prices are quoted in French francs.</p>
<p>The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
